# island_canyon.jsc - low approach into the tallest island nearby, near and high views.
# Checks (group B): terrain occludes terrain correctly (no see-through walls), terraces with
# lit/dark faces and side walls, no EMPTY pixels.
0     state title
+0    state free
+0    view 0
+0.5  seek land 30 260
+1.0  shot approach
+1.0  shot near
+0    assert empty_px == 0
+0.5  shot close
+0    assert empty_px == 0
+0.1  view 2
+0.5  shot high_view
+0    assert empty_px == 0
+0    sheet island_canyon 2
+0    end
